# YAGNI

Follow YAGNI principles in all code development for this project.

- Ship the smallest change that satisfies the request.
- Reuse `Visualizer`, DS visualizers, CSS variables, and existing section markup.
- No new libraries, build tools, or frameworks unless explicitly requested.
- No speculative algorithms, extra pages, or unused abstractions.
- Prefer editing the existing three source files (`index.html`, `style.css`, `app.js`) over adding new ones.
